{
  "description": "Secrets in the administration calls: user passwords, the cluster primary node's password and one-time code, the SSO client secret and API tokens. Technitium's documentation marks no member as secret; these members carry credentials by their documented meaning (pass, newPass, totp, primaryNodePassword, primaryNodeTotp, ssoClientSecret and token in APIDOCS.md, v15.5.0). Inputs accept a string or a Redacted value; outputs are always Redacted (technitium.api#redactedOutput).",
